From: BridgeVM contributors
Subject: [PATCH] OvmfPkg/QemuRamfbDxe: offer common desktop resolutions

QemuRamfbDxe offers only 640x480, 800x600 and 1024x768. A guest without its
own display driver, such as Windows on the Basic Display Adapter, keeps the
mode the firmware set, so the largest desktop it can have is 1024x768.

Add the common 16:9, 16:10 and 5:4 desktop modes up to 2560x1600. The first
three entries keep their numbers, so a saved PlatformConfig preference and the
default 800x600 console still select the same modes. The framebuffer is sized
for the largest mode (about 16 MB).

diff --git a/OvmfPkg/QemuRamfbDxe/QemuRamfb.c b/OvmfPkg/QemuRamfbDxe/QemuRamfb.c
index 5a1044f..fabe0ab 100644
--- a/OvmfPkg/QemuRamfbDxe/QemuRamfb.c
+++ b/OvmfPkg/QemuRamfbDxe/QemuRamfb.c
@@ -54,6 +54,54 @@ STATIC EFI_GRAPHICS_OUTPUT_MODE_INFORMATION  mQemuRamfbModeInfo[] = {
     0,    // Version
     1024, // HorizontalResolution
     768,  // VerticalResolution
+  },{
+    0,    // Version
+    1280, // HorizontalResolution
+    720,  // VerticalResolution
+  },{
+    0,    // Version
+    1280, // HorizontalResolution
+    800,  // VerticalResolution
+  },{
+    0,    // Version
+    1280, // HorizontalResolution
+    1024, // VerticalResolution
+  },{
+    0,    // Version
+    1366, // HorizontalResolution
+    768,  // VerticalResolution
+  },{
+    0,    // Version
+    1440, // HorizontalResolution
+    900,  // VerticalResolution
+  },{
+    0,    // Version
+    1600, // HorizontalResolution
+    900,  // VerticalResolution
+  },{
+    0,    // Version
+    1600, // HorizontalResolution
+    1200, // VerticalResolution
+  },{
+    0,    // Version
+    1680, // HorizontalResolution
+    1050, // VerticalResolution
+  },{
+    0,    // Version
+    1920, // HorizontalResolution
+    1080, // VerticalResolution
+  },{
+    0,    // Version
+    1920, // HorizontalResolution
+    1200, // VerticalResolution
+  },{
+    0,    // Version
+    2560, // HorizontalResolution
+    1440, // VerticalResolution
+  },{
+    0,    // Version
+    2560, // HorizontalResolution
+    1600, // VerticalResolution
   }
 };
 
